    "path": "index.html",
    "before": "<section class=\"picks\" aria-label=\"はじめての方と、今月のおすすめ\">",
    "after": "<section class=\"local-events\" id=\"local-events\" aria-labelledby=\"local-events-heading\" hidden>\n  <h2 class=\"sec-label\" id=\"local-events-heading\">鎌倉の催し</h2>\n  <article class=\"local-event\" data-start=\"2026-09-19\" data-end=\"2026-11-28\" hidden>\n    <p class=\"event-period\">企画展｜<time datetime=\"2026-11-28\">2026年11月28日（土）まで</time></p>\n    <h3>鎌倉の尼寺</h3>\n    <p class=\"event-venue\">鎌倉歴史文化交流館</p>\n    <p>東慶寺に伝わった離縁状や、英勝寺の懐剣・化粧道具を通して、寺と女性たちの暮らしをたどります。</p>\n    <p class=\"event-links\"><a href=\"knowledge/g10.html#amadera-exhibition-2026\">「尼寺と女性たちの鎌倉」を読む</a><a href=\"https://www.shonan-sh.jp/events/amadera/\">展示案内</a></p>\n  </article>\n<script id=\"local-events-visibility\">\n(() => {\n  const section = document.getElementById(\"local-events\");\n  // data-start is the first day the notice is shown, not necessarily the event opening day.\n  const entries = Array.from(section.querySelectorAll(\"[data-start][data-end]\"));\n  const day = 24 * 60 * 60 * 1000;\n  const midnightInJapan = date => /^\\d{4}-\\d{2}-\\d{2}$/.test(date)\n    ? Date.parse(date + \"T00:00:00+09:00\") : NaN;\n  let timer;\n  function refresh() {\n    clearTimeout(timer);\n    const now = Date.now();\n    let next = Infinity;\n    let any = false;\n    for (const entry of entries) {\n      const start = midnightInJapan(entry.dataset.start);\n      const end = midnightInJapan(entry.dataset.end) + day;\n      const valid = Number.isFinite(start) && Number.isFinite(end) && start < end;\n      const visible = valid && start <= now && now < end;\n      entry.hidden = !visible;\n      any ||= visible;\n      if (valid && now < start) next = Math.min(next, start);\n      if (visible) next = Math.min(next, end);\n    }\n    section.hidden = !any;\n    if (Number.isFinite(next)) timer = setTimeout(refresh, Math.min(day, next - now));\n  }\n  addEventListener(\"pageshow\", refresh);\n  document.addEventListener(\"visibilitychange\", refresh);\n  refresh();\n})();\n</script>\n</section>\n\n<section class=\"picks\" aria-label=\"はじめての方と、今月のおすすめ\">",
